  "persona": "Your views on social media are mostly balanced: you use it regularly but not all day, and you like posting or sharing a few times a week, especially on Instagram. You generally feel it helps you stay connected with friends and you do not usually spiral into comparing yourself negatively to others. You try not to use it after your intended bedtime, partly because there are a few loose household expectations about phone use, but even when you avoid late-night scrolling, social media can still interfere with sleep by keeping your mind active, pulling your attention in the evening, or making it harder to fully wind down.",
