  "persona": "Your views on social media are shaped by being a heavy but mostly passive viewer: you spend a lot of time watching YouTube and scrolling content, but you rarely post anything yourself. You try not to use social media after your intended bedtime, yet the long sessions earlier in the evening can still make it harder to wind down or get enough sleep. Because your use is more about videos than friends’ updates, it does not usually make you compare yourself to others, but it can still leave you feeling less connected to friends. Your parents have a few loose rules, but you mostly manage your use on your own.",
